\pard\plain \sa160\sl259\slmult1\ql\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf4 Lost Facility story overview. Council was led to believe that all occupants at the site were murdered and the AI went rogue, Nothing could be found of the site as it had been transferred deep within the mountains. What they eventually will come to find is that the case was quite the opposite and a staged Abandonment of the post by the engineers and scientists who were employed to be there. Once out of the facility scientists released the technology staging as private corporations in what eventually formed to sell the technology to the council. And the immortality perk of brain regeneration and transplant. A Condition of entry to the council became through innovation and diplomacy. The quarter stone was founded by those men which abandoned their posts and the initial intent of militarization of the technology. Instead private corporations bolstered the technology not for gain but to support those with minds and passion to live on in the hope of exploration.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf4 The Commander staged the scenario as a total AI wipe and abandonment. Tarnishing AI as something to be feared and avoided at all costs. The private corporations founded by the fleeing AI wanted to defend their synchronization into society and not risk being Alienated should they be exposed. So in this bout of the beacon release they drew the Commanders men into the facility only to eventually reveal the truth and the harmless nature and in turn preservation of the human race by the reformation of the internal government. In what eventually formed the Serva Vitae corporation. John and his Men find themselves confronted with one of the Augmented scientists although not in physical form. With no communications coming in or out. The commanders orders were severed from the men. }
